[{"id":"Mzc2-q01","number":1,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Brom (<img alt=\"\\tiny Br_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%20Br_2\" />) diekstrak dari laut mati ( Dead Sea ), ditransportasi sebagai larutan 52% massa kalsium bromida. Massa brom (dalam ton) yang terkandung dalam 100 tom larutan ini adalah","choices":["15,6 ton","20,8 ton","29,4 ton","41,6 ton","52,0 ton"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTUwNTE"},{"id":"Mzc2-q02","number":2,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Magnesium sebanyak 2,4 g dimasukkan ke dalam 350 mL larutan HCI 1,0 M. Setelah reaksi selesai, <img alt=\"\\tiny MgCI_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%20MgCI_2\" /> yang terbentuk sebanyak 4,75 gram. Persen hasil <img alt=\"\\tiny MgCI_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%20MgCI_2\" /> adalah :</p><p>","choices":["25","50","75","90","100<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTUwNTI"},{"id":"Mzc2-q03","number":3,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Nitrogliserin, suatu bahan peladak, terurai sesuai persamaan berikut :<br /><img alt=\"\\small 4C_3H_5(N0_3)_3(s) \\rightarrow 12CO_2(g) + 10H_2O(g) + 6N_2(g) + O_2(g)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%204C_3H_5%28N0_3%29_3%28s%29%20%5Crightarrow%2012CO_2%28g%29%20&amp;plus;%2010H_2O%28g%29%20&amp;plus;%206N_2%28g%29%20&amp;plus;%20O_2%28g%29\" /><br /> Jika 260 g nitrogliserin terurai maka volume gas yang dihasilkan pada tekanan 1,2 atm dan 27^oC adalah:</p>","choices":["41 L","105 L","130 L","170 L","235 L"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTUwNTM"},{"id":"Mzc2-q04","number":4,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Tekanan osmosis dapat digunakan untuk menentukan berat molekul protein. Jika 1,00 g protein dilarutkan dalam 100mL air, tekanan osmosisnya menjadi 92,90 mmHg. Massa molekul protein tersebut adalag ( asum: i = 1 dan suhu <img alt=\"\\small 25^oC\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%2025%5EoC\" />):","choices":["100","400","1000","2000","4000"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTUwNTQ"},{"id":"Mzc2-q05","number":5,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20220218101326.PNG\" style=\"height:184px; width:450px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTUwNTU"},{"id":"Mzc2-q06","number":6,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara psangan molekul berikut ini yang menunjukkan bahwa dipoi permeanen dalam molekul I lebih besar dibandingkan dalam molekul II adalah:<br /> &nbsp;</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20220218103132.PNG\" style=\"height:583px; width:333px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTUwNTY"},{"id":"Mzc2-q07","number":7,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Berdasarkan struktur senyawa berikut ini :</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20220218103622.PNG\" style=\"height:179px; width:226px\" /></p><p>Jumlah ikatan sigma ( <img alt=\"\\small \\sigma\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Csigma\" />&nbsp;) pi ( <img alt=\"\\small \\pi\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cpi\" /> ) dalam struktur senyawa tersebut masing masing adalah :","choices":["10 Ikata <img alt=\"\\small \\sigma\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Csigma\" />&nbsp;dan 13 ikatan <img alt=\"\\small \\pi\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cpi\" />","13 Ikata <img alt=\"\\small \\sigma\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Csigma\" />&nbsp;dan 13 ikatan <img alt=\"\\small \\pi\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cpi\" />","15 Ikata <img alt=\"\\small \\sigma\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Csigma\" />&nbsp;dan 6 ikatan <img alt=\"\\small \\pi\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cpi\" />","16 Ikata <img alt=\"\\small \\sigma\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Csigma\" />&nbsp;dan 6 ikatan <img alt=\"\\small \\pi\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cpi\" />","&nbsp;17 Ikata <img alt=\"\\small \\sigma\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Csigma\" />&nbsp;dan 7 ikatan <img alt=\"\\small \\pi\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cpi\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTUwNTc"},{"id":"Mzc2-q08","number":8,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Sejak tahun 1850, sebagai besar buku di cetak pada kertas asam yang mengakibatkan buku menjadi rapuh dan cepat rusak karena mangandung residu asam dan sedikit air yang bertahan di kertas dan uap dietilzink, <img alt=\"\\small Zn(C_2H_5)_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20Zn%28C_2H_5%29_2\" />. Reaksi di Reaksi dientilzink dengan suatu asam HX menghasilkan etana :</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20220218104135.PNG\" style=\"height:158px; width:467px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTUwNTg"},{"id":"Mzc2-q09","number":9,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Reaksi<img alt=\"\\small 3O_2 \\rightarrow 2O_3 \\frac{}{}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%203O_2%20%5Crightarrow%202O_3%20%5Cfrac%7B%7D%7B%7D\" />berlangsung dengan laju hilangnya <img alt=\"\\small O_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20O_2\" /> setara dengan 0,60 mol.L det.<br /> Besar laju terbentuknya <img alt=\"\\small O_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20O_3\" /> ( dalam mol/L det) adalah :</p>","choices":["1,20","0,90","0,60","0,40","0,10"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTUwNTk"},{"id":"Mzc2-q10","number":10,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Reaksi<img alt=\"\\small 2C_4H_6 \\rightarrow C_8H_{12}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202C_4H_6%20%5Crightarrow%20C_8H_%7B12%7D\" />, Hukum lajunya adalah<img alt=\"\\small r = k[C_4H_6]^2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20r%20%3D%20k%5BC_4H_6%5D%5E2\" />. Jika <img alt=\"\\small [C_4H_6] = 2,0 M\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5BC_4H_6%5D%20%3D%202%2C0%20M\" />&nbsp;, Laju rekasinya adalah 0,106 M/det. Jika <img alt=\"\\small [C_4H_6] = 4,0 M\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5BC_4H_6%5D%20%3D%204%2C0%20M\" />, maka laju reaksinya adalah :</p><p>","choices":["0,022M/det","0,053M/det","0,106M/det","0,212M/det","0,424 M/det"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTUwNjA"},{"id":"Mzc2-q11","number":11,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Pada masing masing reaksi kesetimbangan dalam pilihan jawaban di bawah ini dilakukkan dua perubahan yang terpisah :<br /> (i) tekanan di turunkan pada suhu tetap;<br /> (ii) &nbsp;Suhu dinaikkan pada tekanan tetap.</p><p>Di antara rekasi kesetimbangan berikut manakah yang menghasilkan kenaikan dalam jumlah produk ketika kedua perubahan di atas dilakukan adalah :</p><p><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20220218114655.PNG\" style=\"height:99px; width:450px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTUwNjE"},{"id":"Mzc2-q12","number":12,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Perhatikan reaksi kesetimbangan berikut :<br /><img alt=\"\\small CH_3\\: COOH(aq) \\rightleftharpoons CHCOO^{-aq} + H^{-aq} + kalor\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20CH_3%5C%3A%20COOH%28aq%29%20%5Crightleftharpoons%20CHCOO%5E%7B-aq%7D%20&amp;plus;%20H%5E%7B-aq%7D%20&amp;plus;%20kalor\" /></p><p>Pada saat t_1, sistem kesetimbangan mengalami gangguan seperti plot pada grafik berikut:</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20220218130050.PNG\" style=\"height:199px; width:369px\" /><br /> Gangguan yang diberikan pada saat<img alt=\"\\small t_1\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20t_1\" /> adalah sebagai akibat dari :&nbsp;","choices":["Penambahan HCI","Suhu diturunkan","Penambahan <img alt=\"\\small NaCH_3COO\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20NaCH_3COO\" />","Penambahan <img alt=\"\\small CH_3COOH\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20CH_3COOH\" />","Volume wadah bertambah<br /> &nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTUwNjI"},{"id":"Mzc2-q13","number":13,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Perbandingan volume yang harus dicampurkan antara lautan <img alt=\"\\small NH_3, 0,1 M (K_b = 2x10^{-5})\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20NH_3%2C%200%2C1%20M%20%28K_b%20%3D%202x10%5E%7B-5%7D%29\" /> dan HCI 0,1 M agar diperoleh larutan buffer yang memiliki pH = 9 + log 3 adalah :","choices":["2:3","3:1","3:5","5:2","5:3"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTUwNjM"},{"id":"Mzc2-q14","number":14,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Perhatikan kurva tirasi antara larutan asam lemah dengan larutan natrium hidroksida di bawah ini :</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20220218140311.PNG\" style=\"height:243px; width:338px\" /></p><p>Perkiraan nilai pK_a dari asam lemah tersebut adalah :","choices":["<img alt=\"\\tiny pKa\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%20pKa\" /> = 2,7","<img alt=\"\\tiny pKa\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%20pKa\" /> = 4,5","<img alt=\"\\tiny pKa\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%20pKa\" /> = 7,0","<img alt=\"\\tiny pKa\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%20pKa\" /> = 9,5","<img alt=\"\\tiny pKa\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctiny%20pKa\" /> = 13,0"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTUwNjQ"},{"id":"Mzc2-q15","number":15,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Jika 50,0 mL sampel larutan ammonium hidroksida dititrasi dengan asam sulfat:<br /><img alt=\"\\small 2NH_4OH(aq) + H_2SO_4(aq) \\rightarrow (NH_4)_SO_4(aq) + 2H_2O(i)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202NH_4OH%28aq%29%20&amp;plus;%20H_2SO_4%28aq%29%20%5Crightarrow%20%28NH_4%29_SO_4%28aq%29%20&amp;plus;%202H_2O%28i%29\" /><br /> untuk mencapai titik akhir dengan indikator metil merah, dibutuhkan 25,0 mL asam sulfat 0,200 M. Moralitas basa tersebut adalah :","choices":["0,100 M","0,150 M","0,200 M","0,300 M","0,400 M"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTUwNjU"},{"id":"Mzc2-q16","number":16,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Larutan NaCI ditambahkan sedikit demi sedikir ke dalam larutan 0,010 M yang masing masing mengadung ion <img alt=\"\\small Cu^+, Ag^+, Au^+ dan TI^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20Cu%5E&amp;plus;%2C%20Ag%5E&amp;plus;%2C%20Au%5E&amp;plus;%20dan%20TI%5E&amp;plus;\" /> . Nilai Ksp masing-masing senyawa kloridanya berturut turut adalah<img alt=\"\\small 1,9X10^{-7} , 1,6X 10^{-10}, 2,0X10^{-13}\\: dan\\: 1,9X10^4\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%201%2C9X10%5E%7B-7%7D%20%2C%201%2C6X%2010%5E%7B-10%7D%2C%202%2C0X10%5E%7B-13%7D%5C%3A%20dan%5C%3A%201%2C9X10%5E4\" />. Senyawa klorida yang akan mengendap pertama kali adalah","choices":["CuCI(s)","AqCI(s)","AuCI(s)","TICI(s)","&nbsp;Semua mengendap pada saat yang sama"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTUwNjY"},{"id":"Mzc2-q17","number":17,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Di antara reaksi berikut ini yang dapat diungkapkan dengan tetapan kesetimbangan basa <img alt=\"\\small K_b\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20K_b\" /> adalah :</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20220219092225.PNG\" style=\"height:124px; width:289px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTUwNjc"},{"id":"Mzc2-q18","number":18,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Suatu sel elektrokimia terdiri dari elektroda perak dan elektroda emas yang masing-masing direndam dalam larutan <img alt=\"\\small Ag^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20Ag%5E&amp;plus;\" />1 M dan <img alt=\"\\small Au^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20Au%5E&amp;plus;\" /> 1 M. Bila diketahui <img alt=\"\\small E^o Ag^+ | Ag = +0,7991\\: v\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20E%5Eo%20Ag%5E&amp;plus;%20%7C%20Ag%20%3D%20&amp;plus;0%2C7991%5C%3A%20v\" /> dan <img alt=\"\\small E^o Au^+Au = +1,68\\: \\: V\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20E%5Eo%20Au%5E&amp;plus;Au%20%3D%20&amp;plus;1%2C68%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20V\" />, Maka potensial sel tersebut adalah&nbsp;","choices":["-0,44 V&nbsp;","0,00 V","+0,44 V","+0,88 V","+2,48 V"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTUwNjg"},{"id":"Mzc2-q19","number":19,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Selama elektrolisis air laut dalam sel diafragma, dihasilkan gas klor, gas hidrogen dan natrium hidroksida. Rasio molar produk elektrolisis ini adalah :<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20220219093043.PNG\" style=\"height:150px; width:413px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTUwNjk"},{"id":"Mzc2-q20","number":20,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Perhatikan sel volta berikut ini :</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20220219093122.PNG\" style=\"height:172px; width:400px\" /></p><p>Jika sel volta tersebut digunakan, maka pernyataan yang benar adalah&nbsp;","choices":["Elektroda aluminium adalah katoda dan elektroda zink adalah anoda.","Elektron mengalir dari elektroda zink ke elektroda aluminium","ion nitrat mengalir melalui jembatan garam ke larutan aluminium nitrat","Setengah reaksi yang terjadi di elektroda zink adalah <img alt=\"\\small Zn \\rightarrow Zn^2+ 2e\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20Zn%20%5Crightarrow%20Zn%5E2&amp;plus;%202e\" />","Elektroda aluminium dan zink beratnya tetap"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTUwNzA"},{"id":"Mzc2-q21","number":21,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Suatu senyawa kromium dengan rumus umum <img alt=\"\\small CrCI_36H_2O\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20CrCI_36H_2O\" />, bila dilarutka dalam air membentuk ion kompleks dengan larutan AgCI. Rumus kimia ion kompleks dari <img alt=\"\\small Cr^{3+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20Cr%5E%7B3&amp;plus;%7D\" /> ini dalam larutan tersebut adalah&nbsp;</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20220219093906.PNG\" style=\"height:111px; width:164px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTUwNzE"}]
